Backend REST Go généré par [ForgeKit](https://github.com/forgekit/forgekit).

Auteur : {{ .Author }}

## Architecture

```
cmd/                 → entrée, wiring, graceful shutdown
internal/domain/     → entités + interfaces (ports)
internal/application/→ cas d'usage (User, Health)
internal/infrastructure/ → PostgreSQL, configuration
internal/transport/  → HTTP (Chi)
migrations/          → schéma PostgreSQL
tests/               → intégration (placeholder)
```

**Dépendances autorisées :**

| Couche | Peut importer |
|--------|---------------|
| domain | stdlib uniquement |
| application | domain |
| infrastructure | domain, drivers externes |
| transport | application, domain, infrastructure (composition root) |

## Démarrage

```bash
cp .env.example .env
docker compose -f docker/docker-compose.yml up --build
curl http://localhost:{{ .HTTPPort }}/health
curl -X POST http://localhost:{{ .HTTPPort }}/users -d '{"email":"a@b.com","name":"Alice"}' -H 'Content-Type: application/json'
```

## Tests

```bash
go test ./...
```

